  "description": "Chicken isn't generally the go-to meat for fajitas (flavorful skirt steak is the deserving star usually), but this flavor-packed marinade made with cilantro, tart lime juice, brown sugar, cumin, and crushed red pepper makes it a worthy stand-in. Here, we thread the chicken pieces onto skewers and cook them kebab-style.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 2 hr 5 min.\n\nNotes: If chicken thighs do not cube well, cut the meat into strips larger than 4 cm and fold it over when threading onto the skewers to make a cube-like shape.",
